ning 'SMTP 554 rejected', and a history row with outcome 'failed' and that reason is stored\",\n     \"when\": \"an authenticated staff user calls the send-reminder endpoint\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"the failed attempt in AC-13.1 has happened\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-13.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"INV-1042 is still in the overdue list with latest reminder outcome 'failed', and its details show latest outcome 'failed'\",\n     \"when\": \"the overdue list and the invoice details are requested\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"If the email sender returns an error when a reminder is handed to it, then the Invoice Reminders API shall return an error response with outcome 'failed' and the error reason, record the attempt as failed with the sender's error message as the reason, and keep the invoice in the overdue list.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-13\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-4\",\n    \"Q-8\",\n    \"ASM-13\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"no token, and separately an expired token\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-14.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"each response is 401 with no invoice or customer data in the body, the stub email sender receives no message, and no history row is added\",\n     \"when\": \"the overdue list, invoice detail and send-reminder endpoints are called\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"a valid token for any staff user with no special role\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-14.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"none returns 401 or 403 and each succeeds (2xx)\",\n     \"when\": \"the overdue list, invoice detail and send-reminder endpoints are called for an overdue invoice with a billing email\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"If a request to any Invoice Reminders endpoint has no valid staff authentication from the existing API, then the Invoice Reminders API shall reject it with HTTP 401 without returning invoice data, sending email or changing data.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-14\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"Q-1\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"a signed-in staff user and 3 overdue invoices for two customers\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-15.1\",\n     \"level\": \"manual\",\n     \"then\": \"the table narrows to matching rows after each filter, shows the listed columns, and every row has a 'Send reminder' button\",\n     \"when\": \"the user opens the overdue list screen, picks one customer, then picks a bucket (e.g. 7–30 or 31–60)\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"the overdue list screen is showing INV-1042\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-15.2\",\n     \"level\": \"manual\",\n     \"then\": \"the invoice detail screen for INV-1042 opens\",\n     \"when\": \"the user clicks INV-1042's invoice number\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"The overdue list screen shall show overdue invoices in a table with invoice number, customer, amount, due date, days overdue and latest reminder outcome, plus a customer filter, a days-overdue bucket filter, a 'Send reminder' button on each row, and a link from each row's invoice number to the invoice detail screen.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-15\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-5\",\n    \"I-6\",\n    \"ASM-4\",\n    \"ASM-7\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"a signed-in staff user on the overdue list and an email sender slowed to take 5 seconds\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-16.1\",\n     \"level\": \"manual\",\n     \"then\": \"the button is disabled until the response arrives, only one history entry is created, and afterwards the button is enabled again and the new outcome is shown\",\n     \"when\": \"the user presses 'Send reminder' on a row and tries to press it again within the 5 seconds\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"the email sender is set up to fail\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-16.2\",\n     \"level\": \"manual\",\n     \"then\": \"an error message saying 